{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/944450-left-behind","id":944450,"title":"Left Behind","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-05T12:08:15-07:00","id":944450,"title":"Left Behind","content":"<b>Promethean: the Created 2e</b> is shorter than <b>Promethean: the Created 1e</b>. Part of this is that 2e is considerably more concise; but another part is that there are things in 1e that didn't make it into 2e: Clones, for instance. As well, a lot of material from 1e's supplements got folded into 2e; but a lot didn't. <br /> <br /> The purpose of this thread is two-fold: first, to catalog what hasn't made the transition to 2e; and second, to provide 2e-style updates to the material that has been left behind until such time that 2e supplements give official updates. I'll keep the catalog in this post, and will devote subsequent posts to updates. Note that the updates won't always be particularly loyal to the original material; but where I deviate, it will generally be to add new options. (I'm not counting brief mentions, like the mention of Nuclear Prometheans in PtC1e or the mention of constructs in 2e.)<br /> <br /> <u><b>Promethean: the Created</b></u><br /> \u2713 <b>Going to the Wastes:</b> a technique used to lower your Azoth and to extend your lifespan. <br /> \u2713 <b>Clones:</b> biological copies of people that lack free will. <br /> \u2713 <b>Athanors:</b> the \u201cZ-Splat\u201d. 2e has Athanors, but they're entirely unrelated to 1e's Athanors. <br /> \u2717 <b>Pandoran Mockeries:</b> the Pandoran equivalent of Lineages.<br /> \u2717 <b>Transmutations:</b> Yeah, Transmutations. 2e-style Transmutations cover a lot of the same ground that 1e-style Transmutations did; but they do so in a radically different manner that doesn't have room for everything 1e offered.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Pandora's Book</u></b><br /> <br /> <b><u>Strange Alchemies</u></b><br /> <br /> <b><u>Magnum Opus</u></b><br /> \u2713 <b>Constructs:</b> Prometheans made out of inanimate materials rather than corpses.<br /> \u2713 <b>The Prodigal Demiurge:</b> a Principle-like thing that was kicked out of Heaven and seeks to return. <br /> \u2713 <b>Scions:</b> children of Prometheans.<br /> \u2717 <b>A Maker Dreaming:</b> Prometheans created through dreams.<br /> \u2717 <b>Grandfather Crow, and Other Stories:</b> animal Prometheans.<br /> \u2717 <b>Crossovers:</b> issues that come up when the Created encounter other night-folk. <br /> <br /> <b><u>Saturnine Night</u></b><br /> \u2717 <b>Nuclear Prometheans</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 08-22-2016, 03:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T12:35:01-07:00","id":944463,"title":"","content":"Absence of Going to the Wastes surprised me","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T13:05:33-07:00","id":944481,"title":"","content":"Were animal Prometheans like straight-up reanimated animal corpses, or like people with animal parts grafted on?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T13:06:17-07:00","id":944482,"title":"","content":"The former.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date